  "story": {
    "day": 132,
    "title": "Kaya's Fun Day Out",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya, fourteen, was happy for her trip with grandma.",
      "The day before yesterday, a letter about an amusement park arrived.",
      "Early this morning, their journey close to the South side began.",
      "They took a public bus. During the ride, Kaya ate a sandwich.",
      "She saw a famous actor would appear on the fourteenth.",
      "Kaya stood in the front to enjoy her last game. A wolf puppet looked angry.",
      "Finally, Kaya felt a little sick and needed the bathroom.",
      "She did not attend a concert or bowling.",
      "She bought her own plant, her fourth souvenir, and a new tooth brush.",
      "Mrs. Green's shop did not sell forty kinds.",
      "She did not cycle, but arrived home and gave the plant some water.",
      "Tomorrow, she had class. She hoped the whole world could be this fun."
    ]
  }
